    "notes": "Where the flame tongues and embers rise and the scorch's shape change per cast. The heat wave ticks every 1 s, always."
  },
  "director_notes": "Lisa asked for an area-of-effect flame damage aura. The gameplay read comes first: a warning ring marks the exact edge, the burning ground pulses and a heat wave rolls out on each 1 s damage tick. Flame tongues are short streaky sparks across the whole disc rather than one wall, so the area reads from the top view too. The scorch stays after the spell. Loop 1200-4200 ms."
